*.sql
# ...except the checked-in schema/seed scripts. The project runs ddl-auto=validate with no
# migration framework, so these ARE the schema history — ignoring them meant the RBAC seed
# lived on one developer's machine and nobody could see that the Front Office role had been
# left with zero permissions. Dumps and backups anywhere else stay ignored by the rule above.
!backend/src/main/resources/db/*.sql
